 "notes": [
  "Income statement prints a separate line 'Loss on extinguishment of debt' 279 (expense) between interest expense and EBT; no schema key, recorded in is.other_lines as printed (279, an expense). EBT 636 = OP 944 + other income 6 - interest 35 - loss on extinguishment 279. check_rec 'op+oth-int = ebt' therefore fails by 279 (915 vs 636); published numbers kept.",
