  "Segment-table total expenses 902 = income-statement expenses 910 less gain 8; Corporate Unallocated expense 36 is net of the $4m Corporate gain.",
  "Prior-year (Q3-19) segment expenses/OP recast in this release (e.g. Ratings OP 477 vs 472); total segment OP 936 unchanged.",
  "New in this release: Exhibit 5 adds an 'Adjusted Expenses' table (Total SPGI adjusted expenses 870 for Q3-20).",
  "Non-GAAP adjustments: OP 0 printed (RAT 5, MI (4), Corporate (2)); debt extinguishment 279 pre-tax (below OP); tax 69; after tax 210 ($0.87). Pre-tax total 279 computed, not printed as one line. Corporate: (36) + (2) + 7 = (31) computed vs adjusted (32) published (rounding).",
  "start_ni + item nets + amort = 690 (computed) vs adjusted 689 published (rounding).",
  "Indices Adjusted Net Operating Profit (attributable to the Company) = 112 (adj OP 153 less NCI 41).",
  "Guidance: GAAP EPS cut to $10.00-$10.15 (debt tender premium); excludes potential future impairment charges from new productivity program; adjusted EPS raised to $11.30-$11.45."
 ],
